tch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\)</span> (the carrier of the coded structure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1cb489a34bc2433c\" href=\"?note=1cb489a34bc2433c\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(M,a)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,a)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a[v_0\\mapsto x]\">\\(a[v_0\\mapsto x]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9FormulaCodeSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9FormulaCodeSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"73aeb5eda1445c82\" href=\"?note=73aeb5eda1445c82\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-model9-formula-code-set.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-model9-formula-code-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9DefinableSubsetFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9DefinableSubsetFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}definable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9DefinableSubsetFamily}_S(M,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists S,\\Phi,\\operatorname{Val}_M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\n(S,M,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel9FormulaCodeSet}_S(\\Phi,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}{}\\land v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land\\mathcal D=\\Bigl\\{A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\ \\Bigm|\\ \n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\exists a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(M,a)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\varphi,a[v_0\\mapsto x]\\rangle\\in S\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}definable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9DefinableSubsetFamily}_S(M,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists S,\\Phi,\\operatorname{Val}_M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\n(S,M,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel9FormulaCodeSet}_S(\\Phi,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}{}\\land v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land\\mathcal D=\\Bigl\\{A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\ \\Bigm|\\ \n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\exists a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(M,a)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\varphi,a[v_0\\mapsto x]\\rangle\\in S\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\)</span>, not the structure code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>. The assignment <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> supplies parameters, while the distinguished variable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> is updated to the tested element.</li>\n<li>The same language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> now types the structure, its full formula set, term evaluation, and satisfaction relation; the former two-place satisfaction-class call hid these incompatible choices.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1cb489a34bc2433c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-model9-formula-code-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"73aeb5eda1445c82","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-model9-formula-code-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f